  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報352期-封面作品：竹仔湖印象"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKOMCQtaLGaIc4KKHsTIMftMSFpXNwUPecv_mfJ9gnYz4kGUaIohjMD-L7aGy7kmkadgZjG3ZTJ9piU9gMKQjDYAeMI0_PeO3kmlyQVd4KP6GE4ihSC9HMMl2K14haj1P9mdZvLTmakR9O_UMrocT61cNL9yNUQLIuK4D0X0L1gyW6u5KorgcUk_q5-NzQ/s4320/%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E5%9C%96_%E6%9E%97%E9%87%87%E9%A2%A8-%E7%AB%B9%E5%AD%90%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A101.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3200\" data-original-width=\"4320\" height=\"474\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhKOMCQtaLGaIc4KKHsTIMftMSFpXNwUPecv_mfJ9gnYz4kGUaIohjMD-L7aGy7kmkadgZjG3ZTJ9piU9gMKQjDYAeMI0_PeO3kmlyQVd4KP6GE4ihSC9HMMl2K14haj1P9mdZvLTmakR9O_UMrocT61cNL9yNUQLIuK4D0X0L1gyW6u5KorgcUk_q5-NzQ/w640-h474/%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2%E5%9C%96_%E6%9E%97%E9%87%87%E9%A2%A8-%E7%AB%B9%E5%AD%90%E6%B9%96%E5%8D%B0%E8%B1%A101.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><p></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span>作品名稱</span><span>：</span><span><b>竹仔湖印象</b></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span style=\"text-align: left;\"><b>作品說明</b></span><b>：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你若想beh出外清幽--一-下，tī山lap仔底ê竹仔湖，是一个真好ê所在，你看bē著都市ê ak-tsak，kan-na看ē著青山、清天、輕煙、流水，iáu-koh有美麗ê花園。若是m̄甘tńg--去，你ē-sái買一把海芋iah是繡球花，tī厝內延續山內得--著ê快樂。</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者簡介</b></span><b>：</b></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">林采風，我是tī台南縣學甲頂洲大漢--ê，西瓜、紅跤笭kap做醮是我ê故鄉印象。我kah意講台語ê時hit種「kap生份人變朋友」ê魔法。Mā真kah意聽台語多變ê音調。自做阿母以後，我開始感覺，母語ê傳承是lán ē-sái送hōo囡仔ê禮物，希望未來囡仔ē對tsit phiàn土地有無形ê認同感。我mā想beh kā我對台灣ê感情用文字kap圖記錄--落-來，分享hōo lán愛台灣ê朋友。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作年代</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">2023</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">創作形式</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">蠟筆</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">作品尺寸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">18X13.5cm</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLu98YNssLpCaHHQ9681csb7uarlxFWzoW81IKZiZ-m4RwSk8WN0J-lL-ULxBilEeO_PGR_0jgU5X3bgSL-2dvL4wKfNfxTlHr4PWCqd018zH9sOkAgF7vScWUVjgo_VroXPiyJnglm24pJtfxj-ea128WEjJvSBynUw6K7xvdj4E3hI24wvcQj59OQI1r/s1424/352%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLu98YNssLpCaHHQ9681csb7uarlxFWzoW81IKZiZ-m4RwSk8WN0J-lL-ULxBilEeO_PGR_0jgU5X3bgSL-2dvL4wKfNfxTlHr4PWCqd018zH9sOkAgF7vScWUVjgo_